{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "回调入口",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 95.92,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "重入的入口，不只是转 ETH。",
   "spoken": "虫入的入口，不只是转 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.96,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.304
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "2020 年 4 月的 imBTC，是一种 ERC-777 代币。转账时，会回调持有人注册的钩子。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 4 月的 imBTC，是一种 ERC-777 代币。转账时，会回掉持有人注册的钩子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-01.wav",
   "start": 4.78,
   "dur": 8.96,
   "speechStart": 4.872,
   "speechEnd": 13.538
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "借贷协议 Lendf.Me 的存款函数，返回时用旧值写回余额，抵押记录因此虚高。",
   "spoken": "借贷协议 Lendf.Me 的存款函数，返回时用旧值写回余额，抵押记录因此虚高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-02.wav",
   "start": 13.96,
   "dur": 8.64,
   "speechStart": 14.05,
   "speechEnd": 22.383
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "攻击者借走约 2500 万美元的资产，按事发时估值。据 The Block 报道，资金后来已归还。",
   "spoken": "攻击者借走约 2500 万美元的资产，按事发时估值。据 The Block 报道，资金后来已归还。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-03.wav",
   "start": 22.82,
   "dur": 8.72,
   "speechStart": 22.913,
   "speechEnd": 31.307
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "在 BNB Chain 上，很多项目分叉自以太坊协议。",
   "spoken": "在 BNB Chain 上，很多项目分叉自以太坊协议。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-04.wav",
   "start": 31.76,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 31.85,
   "speechEnd": 35.455
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "原协议只接受白名单代币。分叉项目放开成任意代币都能上架，却没给存款函数加锁。",
   "spoken": "原协议只接受白名单代币。分叉项目放开成任意代币都能上架，却没给存款函数加锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-05.wav",
   "start": 35.9,
   "dur": 8.24,
   "speechStart": 35.995,
   "speechEnd": 43.907
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "攻击者上架一个自己部署的代币，在转账函数里回调存款，同一笔资产被记了两次。",
   "spoken": "攻击者上架一个自己部署的代币，在转账函数里回掉存款，同一笔资产被记了两次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-06.wav",
   "start": 44.36,
   "dur": 7.44,
   "speechStart": 44.36,
   "speechEnd": 51.57
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "允许任意代币，就等于允许任意回调。上架流程本身，就是安全边界。",
   "spoken": "允许任意代币，就等于允许任意回掉。上架流程本身，就是安全边界。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-07.wav",
   "start": 52.02,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 52.111,
   "speechEnd": 58.366
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "2024 年 9 月的 Penpie 也类似，损失约 2700 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 9 月的 Penpie 也类似，损失约 2700 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-08.wav",
   "start": 58.8,
   "dur": 4.96,
   "speechStart": 58.897,
   "speechEnd": 63.564
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "攻击者无许可创建市场，市场用了恶意代币。",
   "spoken": "攻击者无许可创建市场，市场用了恶意代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-09.wav",
   "start": 63.98,
   "dur": 3.84,
   "speechStart": 63.98,
   "speechEnd": 67.63
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "批量领取奖励的函数没有锁，攻击者在回调里存入资产，把存款变成了奖励。",
   "spoken": "批量领取奖励的函数没有锁，攻击者在回掉里存入资产，把存款变成了奖励。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-10.wav",
   "start": 68.04,
   "dur": 6.56,
   "speechStart": 68.04,
   "speechEnd": 74.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "所以审计的第一步，是列出所有外部调用。代币转账、NFT 安全转账、回调、低级 call，一个都不漏。",
   "spoken": "所以审计的第一步，是列出所有外部掉用。代币转账、NFT 安全转账、回掉、低级 call，一个都不漏。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-11.wav",
   "start": 74.82,
   "dur": 9.6,
   "speechStart": 74.91,
   "speechEnd": 84.191
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "然后对每一处问两句。",
   "spoken": "然后对每一处问两句。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-12.wav",
   "start": 84.64,
   "dur": 1.76,
   "speechStart": 84.738,
   "speechEnd": 86.161
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "调用之前，相关状态都更新到最终值了吗？",
   "spoken": "掉用之前，相关状态都更新到最终值了吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-13.wav",
   "start": 86.62,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 86.711,
   "speechEnd": 90.344
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-14",
   "text": "读写同一状态的入口，共用同一把锁吗？",
   "spoken": "读写同一状态的入口，共用同一把锁吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-14.wav",
   "start": 91.04,
